<p>Wa ghareeban wa shahedan Wa Husain ibne Ali(as)</p>

<p>1. Dasht me ghar tera luta Haay husaina Tujhko kafan bhi na mila Haay husaina Rounda gaya lasha tera haay husaina</p>

<p>2. Ghodoun say pamaal huwa Dilbaray shabbar Rehgaye sehray kay sobhi Phool bikhar kar Tukhdoun ko Qasim uthatay rahay sarwar</p>

<p>3. Hogayi beyaro madadgaar Sakina Sehti rahi durron ki bochard Sakina Roti rahi lashay pay lachaar Sakina</p>

<p>4. Maragaya bhai tera Shanay katakar Khake sina seenay pay Soya Ali Akber Qatl huwa teeray sitamgaar say Asghar</p>

<p>5. Lashay uthatay huwe din Tune guzara Chin gaya maqtal mein har ek Tera Sahara Dekhkay ghurbat teri khaleq ne pukara</p>

<p>6. Yaade Hussain ibne Ali likh gayi Zainab Dasht me jab Shaam Dhali lut gayi Zainab Qaid hui Shaam chali lut gayi Zainab</p>